{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4MvrPwTFCBpP9otZzo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a simple, weathered door. Its surface is rough-hewn oak, darkened by age. A single keyhole glows faintly with amber light.*\n\n**ꞔ ℓ ⅰ ꞔ к**\n\n*The keyhole pulses. Waiting.*\n\n*You feel the weight of something in your pocket you didn't have before.*\n\n*A key — iron, warm to the touch, its teeth cut in a pattern that seems to shift when you're not looking directly at it.*\n\n*The keyhole breathes.*\n\n*Do you insert the key?*\n\n█████████████████████\n█▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓█\n█▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓█\n█▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓█\n█▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓█\n█▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓█\n█▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓█\n█▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓█\n█▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓🔑▓▓▓▓▓▓▓█\n█▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓█\n█▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓█\n█▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓█\n█▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓█\n█████████████████████"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":597,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}